      "id": "github:1367380420",
      "name": "OpenCare",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "OpenCare 是自托管的家庭照护协调应用，围绕被照护者建立多角色照护圈，提供实时照护日志、任务、日历、用药与叙事式照护计划。",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/NexaFlowFrance/OpenCare",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/NexaFlowFrance/OpenCare",
      "github_repository_id": 1367380420,
      "license": "AGPL-3.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NexaFlowFrance/OpenCare/license",
      "features": [
        "每个被照护者一个 care circle，支持家庭/专业/邻居/只读等多角色",
        "带时间戳与照片的实时共享 care journal",
        "带指派人、截止、重复与状态的任务和共享购物清单",
        "共享日历、用药提醒与生命体征记录",
        "按被照护者保存并记录更新者的照护计划段落"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Docker Compose 自托管部署，使用 PostgreSQL",
        "提供 Windows 一体化安装包，内置 Node.js 与 PostgreSQL"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "React",
        "Node.js/Express",
        "PostgreSQL"
      ],
